"Penelope was conceived on the third floor of the Echoing Depths, among Water Nymphs."
"Penelope was born with the Advanced Attribute Compelling Allure and the Skill Luring Melody, and can remove neither."
"Penelope never uses her Allure, but weak-willed people fixate on her, and men have hunted her for it."
"Cornelius saved Penelope from a fate worse than death, and it cost him his place in Helenica."
